{
  "file_id": "3591",
  "text_count": 61,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "��������Ah! Sora, look!",
      "_offset": 3676,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "There's a Yokomon. Why's it in\nsuch a hurry?",
      "_offset": 3700,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "Piyomon! Sora! Help!",
      "_offset": 3746,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "Calm down and tell us what\nhappened.",
      "_offset": 3767,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "Hurry, hurry!",
      "_offset": 3804,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "Hurry, hurry!",
      "_offset": 3818,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "It left without saying anything.",
      "_offset": 3832,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "Let's go to the Yokomon village!",
      "_offset": 3865,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "Sora! Piyomon! Over here!",
      "_offset": 3899,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "What in the world is going on?",
      "_offset": 3925,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "Some Yokomon left the village to\nlook for DigiStrawberries, and\nthey haven't come back!",
      "_offset": 3956,
      "_length": 88,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "I know where to find\nDigiStrawberries! Why don't we go\nlook for them together, Sora?",
      "_offset": 4045,
      "_length": 84,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "Of course! How many Yokomon are\nmissing?",
      "_offset": 4130,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "Um...1, 2, 3, 4, 5! Five total.",
      "_offset": 4172,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "Got it! All right, let's look for\nthem!",
      "_offset": 4204,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "Sora, this is where you gather\nDigiStrawberries!",
      "_offset": 4244,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "Hey! Something's buried here!",
      "_offset": 4293,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "Heave-ho!",
      "_offset": 4323,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "*yawn* That was a good nap...",
      "_offset": 4333,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "Whoa! It was sleeping in the\nmiddle of the desert!",
      "_offset": 4363,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "How'd you manage to sleep in this\nhot sand?",
      "_offset": 4414,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "I must've fallen asleep! Thank\nyou, Sora, Piyomon!",
      "_offset": 4458,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "We have to hurry and find the\nrest!",
      "_offset": 4509,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "Here! One left!",
      "_offset": 4545,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "But there aren't any\nDigiStrawberries beyond this\npoint.",
      "_offset": 4561,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "No way. But we've only found\nfour...",
      "_offset": 4618,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "But if we go past this hill, we'll\nget lost, too!",
      "_offset": 4655,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "The last one must have already\nreturned. Let's go back there\ntogether.",
      "_offset": 4709,
      "_length": 70,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "We're back!",
      "_offset": 4780,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "Hey, while we were looking for the\nlost Yokomon, did anyone come\nback?",
      "_offset": 4792,
      "_length": 71,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "Nope! No one did.",
      "_offset": 4864,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "Oh, no! We have to go back to the\ndesert!",
      "_offset": 4882,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "Sora, behind you!",
      "_offset": 4924,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "Ack! There's... another Piyomon?",
      "_offset": 4942,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "A rampagin' Piyomon?!",
      "_offset": 4975,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "It's a different Piyomon. Guys,\nkeep it together! Let's fight!",
      "_offset": 4997,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "The Piyomon's shrinking!",
      "_offset": 5060,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "It must have exhausted its energy.",
      "_offset": 5085,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "I'm glad no one was hurt!",
      "_offset": 5120,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "Thanks, Sora and Piyomon!\nWe'll give you this village's\nancient treasure!",
      "_offset": 5146,
      "_length": 73,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "Wow! Thank you!",
      "_offset": 5220,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "It's our thanks for saving us!",
      "_offset": 5236,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "I'm sorry! I ate a DigiTomato, and\nit made me start rampaging\neverywhere...",
      "_offset": 5267,
      "_length": 75,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "We'll put a sign up to warn\neveryone about those DigiTomatoes!",
      "_offset": 5343,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "Looks like there are four left.",
      "_offset": 5406,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "You're doing well, Sora.",
      "_offset": 5438,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "There's one here, too! Three left!",
      "_offset": 5463,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "Good job, Sora!",
      "_offset": 5498,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "Ah, it's over here! Two left!",
      "_offset": 5514,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "Keep at it, Sora!",
      "_offset": 5544,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "How many Yokomon do we still need\nto find?",
      "_offset": 5562,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "Uh... there are five left. Keep at\nit!",
      "_offset": 5606,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "Uh... there are four left. Keep at\nit!",
      "_offset": 5645,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "Uh... there are three left. Keep\nat it!",
      "_offset": 5684,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "Uh... there are two left. Keep at\nit!",
      "_offset": 5724,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "When they get back, all the lost\nYokomon should go home and get\nsome rest.",
      "_offset": 5762,
      "_length": 75,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "They must be tired and thirsty.",
      "_offset": 5838,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "We'll bring some tasty water from\nOutlook Mountain later!",
      "_offset": 5870,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "We Yokomon and Meramon have been\ndoing fine since that incident.",
      "_offset": 5928,
      "_length": 65,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "But right now, I'm more worried\nabout the Yokomon who haven't\nreturned...",
      "_offset": 5994,
      "_length": 74,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "We'll find them as soon as we can.",
      "_offset": 6069,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    }
  ]
}